{"hero":{"id":84,"name":"Rat King","nameRu":"Крысиный король","className":"hero_ratking","description":"Крысиный король — легендарный криптид и правитель нью-йоркских нор. Он возвышается над своими подданными как размерами и силой, так и непомерным честолюбием.  Не желая больше прятаться под землёй, король огласил своё дерзкое видение будущего, в котором он со своим народом сможет разгуливать по поверхности, не опасаясь снующих по улицам Нью-Йорка фургонов дератизаторов (или, как зовут их сами крысы, «человечьих эскадронов смерти»).<br><br>Шаг первый: захватить Лонг-Айленд.<br>Шаг второй: объявить Лонг-Айленд суверенным государством Крысания.<br>Шаг третий: казнить каждого человека, который откажется покинуть эту новую крысиную утопию.<br><br>Но каким бы безупречным ни был план, король крыс не пожелал полагаться на случай. Чтобы подстраховаться, он решил призвать на свою сторону самого покровителя.","descriptionEn":"The cryptid ruler of the New York Warrens, The Rat King towers over his subjects in size, strength, and ambition. No longer content with hiding underground, the king has revealed his bold vision for a future where he and his subjects can walk the surface without fear of the pest control vans that roam the streets of New York (or as the rats call them: human death squads)<br><br>Step 1: Take control of Long Island<br>Step 2: Declare Long Island as the new sovereign nation of Ratannia<br>Step 3: Execute every human that refuses to leave this new rat utopia<br><br>But air tight as this plan is, the king of rats didn't want to take chances: and so he's decided to summon the patron to help hedge his bets.","lore":"The cryptid ruler of the New York Warrens, The Rat King towers over his subjects in size, strength, and ambition. No longer content with hiding underground, the king has revealed his bold vision for a future where he and his subjects can walk the surface without fear of the pest control vans that roam the streets of New York (or as the rats call them: human death squads)<br><br>Step 1: Take control of Long Island<br>Step 2: Declare Long Island as the new sovereign nation of Ratannia<br>Step 3: Execute every human that refuses to leave this new rat utopia<br><br>But air tight as this plan is, the king of rats didn't want to take chances: and so he's decided to summon the patron to help hedge his bets.","heroRole":"","tags":["Сварливый","Знатный","Настырный"],"heroType":"brawler","complexity":3,"colorHex":"#733033","iconCard":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/ratking_card.png","iconSmall":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/ratking_sm.png","startingStats":{"max_move_speed":6.8,"sprint_speed":1.6,"crouch_speed":4.75,"move_acceleration":4,"light_melee_damage":50,"heavy_melee_damage":116,"max_health":800,"weapon_power":0,"reload_speed":1,"weapon_power_scale":1,"proc_build_up_rate_scale":1,"stamina":3,"base_health_regen":2,"stamina_regen_per_second":0.263,"ability_resource_max":0,"ability_resource_regen_per_second":0,"crit_damage_received_scale":1,"tech_duration":1,"tech_range":1,"ground_dash_distance_in_meters":10,"ground_dash_duration":0.72,"air_dash_distance_in_meters":8,"air_dash_duration":0.51,"ooc_health_regen":0},"levelInfo":{"1":{"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":0},"2":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":200},"3":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":500},"4":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":900},"5":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":1400},"6":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":2000},"7":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityPoints"],"required_gold":2600},"8":{"use_standard_upgrade":true,"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":3200},"9":{"use_standa